{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Ho:</b> This is a sign concerning the exile of Nebuchadnezzar." "<b>The designated first of the nations:</b> They are Israel, and are called 'nations' because they are numerous." "<b>And the house of Israel comes to them:</b> For they are under its dominion."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:15.522313717Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}